NPClassifier-onnx
=================

NPClassifier-onnx is an independent ONNX Runtime inference wrapper for
NPClassifier, with a local HDF5-to-ONNX converter.

Authors
-------
David Niteas <david.ql.d@foxmail.com>

What's shipped
--------------
This repository contains wrapper/inference code, the converter, tests and
documentation only. It does not include NPClassifier HDF5 weights, converted ONNX
files, `index_v1.json` or datasets.

This project is not the official NPClassifier release and is not maintained or
endorsed by the NPClassifier authors. The official implementation and support are
available at https://github.com/mwang87/NP-Classifier.

